  "prefLabel": "Env-A 3802.02 Source",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 3802.02 “Source” means “source” as defined in RSA 125-L:1, V, namely “any entity, building, structure, facility, installation, article, or thing which, in the opinion of the commissioner, emits or may emit a greenhouse gas.”\n\nSource. #9470, eff 5-16-09 (from Env-A 3803.04)",
